          "sorting-categorization"
        ],
        "originality_notes": "Theme: coastal peninsula with neighborhood districts (not a spreadsheet or office). Verb: allocate budget across NPC requests and drag-sort expenses (not passive income collection). Structure: branching quest scenarios where budget choices affect NPC outcomes (not competitive or score-based). Combines budget-allocation puzzles with story-driven NPC consequence chains.",
